WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.410
<i>The winner of match one
of the semifinals is...</i>

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.500
<i>...Gunpla Academy, representing Shizuoka,</i>

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.330
<i>Gunpla</i> Academy
<i>---Gunpla Academy, representing Shizuoka,</i>

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.170
<i>Gunpla Academy
team Celestial Sphere.</i>

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.390
Sorry, Nemesis.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.640
If they hadn't got me...

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.350
Nice fight.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.270
Thank you.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.690
I'm glad you were my teammates.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:27.650
Nemesis...

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:35.820
If the Full Cloth had
had enough particle supply...

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.700
...it would've been my machine
that was defeated.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.410
This battle with you...

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.210
I won't forget it as long as I live.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.750
I'll get my revenge on you.

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:52.380
That's what I should be saying.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:54.710
Someday...

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:56.760
Yes, we'll battle again.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:20.160
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:25.620
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:28.420
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.130
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:36.720
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:41.260
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.890
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:49.440
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:52.190
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:54.900
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:01:54.900 --> 00:02:00.160
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:06.750
Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:28.100
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:32.690
You trusted me with everything,
from team lineup to tactics.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:34.110
I'm sorry for the result.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.650
It's regrettable.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.230
If only you had been
resupplied properly.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.910
I wish Aiba and Tomita were
more talented as fighters...

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.280
I'm sorry to interrupt.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:48.040
But they carried out
my tactics splendidly.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.580
If there's a reason for our defeat,
it's my inexperience.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.500
That's all.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:03:00.010
The repair system loaded
on the Portent saved us all.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:01.010
Yes.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.840
We were facing world-class ability.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:04.680
Darn it!

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.010
It hardly feels like a win.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:10.480
That's because you're inexperienced.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.560
Gunpla is profound and limitless.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.270
I learned that through this battle.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:19.730
But despite that...
No, because of that,

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.740
I want to master it thoroughly.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.200
Yes, keep working hard to improve.

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:30.410
Because you're not champions,
but challengers.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.540
Lucas Nemesis!

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.630
Sekai, I'm sorry.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.550
I won't be able to fight with you.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.880
But my wish will come true someday.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.510
I'll be waiting for you.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.720
Waiting where?

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.810
The Open Tournament.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.850
He's making a prediction.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:59.730
He's saying that you'll go on
to the stage of your namesake.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:03.990
That you're a man who'll fight
on the "world" (sekai) stage.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.910
Having been recognized
by such a mighty player,

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:11.410
you can't be clumsy
when you fight in match two.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.750
In the semifinals, our opponent is...

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.670
...Minato Sakai's team.

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:21.250
Tendaiji Academy!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:26.220
Episode 22
Follow Your Heart

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.260
The time has come, Yuuma.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.560
Prepare yourself.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:33.890
Are you still sore about...

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.850
...your Gunpla losing in the
West Tokyo qualifiers?

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:41.570
That battle taught me
my weakness as a builder.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:43.650
I almost feel grateful.

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:44.740
Then".

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:48.360
...why are you so hostile to Yuuma
that you'd enter the nationals?

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.700
I hate everything about him.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:51.950
But why?

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:56.250
Yuuma, I first met you when
we were elementary school kids.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.830
You went to the nationals...

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.840
...in the Under-13 division.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.590
They called you the second coming...

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.380
...of Sei lori, your hometown champion.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.640
I was a builder, you were a fighter.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.760
Still, I was delighted...

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:15.480
...by the appearance of
a rival my own age.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.560
But you...

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.610
You quit battling just as
you started middle school,

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.610
and said you'd be a builder.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.860
You even took the Grand Prix
while I wasn't there!

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.660
I then planned a showdown
at the Meijin Cup,

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.620
but you've returned to battling.

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:33.870
You take Gunpla too lightly!

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.500
I can't lose to such a wishy-washy guy.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.670
Not as a builder, and not as a fighter!

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.960
He did a wall slam...

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.260
I get it.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.840
Because I ran away, you're...

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.100
Wait!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.430
It's true that You quit Gunpla Battle,
but that was because-

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:55.060
It's fine.
It's true that You quit Gunpla Battle,
but that was because-

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:55.720
It's fine.

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:56.560
You?

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:57.890
Minato.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:04.900
I'm very sorry that my actions...

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:08.070
...made it seem as though I didn't
respect your deep love for Gunpla.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.820
But I won't run away anymore.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:13.410
I promise!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.950
Then show me, when we battle.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.500
Show me just how earnest you are.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:23.920
Ow...

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.130
Yuuma.

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.760
Let's win, Sekai.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.260
Hoshino, you too.

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.300
We'll do it together.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:34.680
Yeah!

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.390
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.770
Sakai, what did you talk about
with Yuuma Kousaka?

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:45.310
I wanted to clear up
my personal feelings.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.860
I feel relieved!

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:49.780
Now I can fight without
hesitation in the semifinals...

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:51.450
...as a member of
the Build Busters.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.410
I'll play Gunpla Battle with you
and win the championship.

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:57.580
So, let's go!

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.710
Sakai...

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.880
<i>We're third-year students,
headed for different high schools.</i>

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.590
<i>This is our last tournament.</i>

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:12.550
<i>I like this team.</i>

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:16.970
<i>I want to play Gunpla Battle
with you all as long as possible.</i>

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.480
Sakai.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.480
You took my words to heart.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:26.230
That's the Osaka spirit.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:28.110
You're acting too cool.

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:32.030
Tendaiji Academy's Gunpla
specialize in high-power attacks...

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:36.820
...made by focusing the energy
of three combined machines.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:39.950
Our Winning Road is
to not let them combine.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:41.910
Even if we fail at that,

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.620
they'll be defenseless
while they're combining.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.420
That's our chance!

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:51.340
I look forward to your victory,
team Try Fighters.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:55.840
<i>And now, the Gunpla Battle
Japanese Championship.</i>

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:56.340
<i>I made</i> it <i>right on</i> time.
<i>And now, the Gunpla Battle
Japanese Championship.</i>

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:56.680
I made it right on time.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:57.350
<i>I made it right on</i> time.
