00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.400
Fumina Hoshino, Star Winning Gundam.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:54.320
Yuuma Kousaka,
Lightning Gundam Full Burnern.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.570
Sekai Kamiki, Try Burning Gundam.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.910
Hideo lsaka, Sora Tryon.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.410
