00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:04.790
Minato Sakai, Riku Tryon.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.330
Team Try Fighters.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.250
Here we go!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.800
Team Build Busters.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.550
Let's g Q!

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.230
Yuu, split up the enemy!

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:32.820
<i>Roger.</i>

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.040
Do they all have
that much firepower?!

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:45.950
<i>Hoshino!</i>

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.460
<i>The enemies have disappeared!</i>

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.710
Where? Where did they go?!

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:55.130
Those foolish words please me!

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.130
<i>Sora Tryon!</i>

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.600
<i>Umi Tryon!</i>

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:08.980
<i>Riku Tryon!</i>

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:14.610
Let's Try On!

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.490
Now's our chance!

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:24.660
Jigen Haoh School!

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.910
<i>(Howling Wave Fist)
Hado Reppaku-Ken!</i>

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:33.710
A barrier?!
A barrier?!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:05.660
<i>TWO" 3!
TWO" 3!</i>

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:09.750
