our combination scene...</i>

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:13.620
You have no sense of romance,
no respect for aesthetics.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.130
<i>I'll show you.</i>

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:23.090
<i>The absolute, exploding,
irresistible and invincible...</i>

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.800
<i>---power of Tryon 3!!</i>

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.690
<i>Now, let's go!</i>

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.730
Armed Booster!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:37.610
I'm going!

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:42.280
Jigen Haoh School!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:45.570
<i>(Holy Fist Punch)
Seiken-Zuki!</i>

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.210
What power!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.790
This won't be like it was
with the Mega Shiki!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.710
<i>Attack the main body!</i>

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.500
<i>I won't let you do that.</i>

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:02.630
Boomerang Stagger!

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:18.730
Sekai!

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:19.650
Sekai!

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:20.730
Sekai!

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:22.230
No.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.570
Did they target the waist joint?

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:28.620
Rotation of the waist is
the lifeline of a martial artist.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:33.500
<i>I thought the Tryon 3 was a
machine that specialized in firepower.</i>

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.870
<i>I might have underestimated it.</i>

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:41.840
No more of that weird technique
you used in the quarterfinals.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.470
M-My back...

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.010
<i>First...</i>

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:47.800
A high mega?!

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:49.180
No!

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:01.400
<i>I'll get you first!</i>

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:05.570
<i>Winning Beam!</i>

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:06.950
<i>Take this!</i>

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.330
That's nothing!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.830
<i>Double Cannonade!</i>

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.500
Full power!

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.970
Liger...

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:35.430
Glare!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.530
<i>How dare you...!</i>

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:53.330
<i>Raptor Breaker!</i>

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:01.250
Now!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.340
It's our chance, Sakai!

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:06.210
Howl, Liger!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.730
M-My machine won't move.

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.690
The wavelength of the shock waves...

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:22.440
...is synchronized to the material
frequency of the plastic.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.520
Let's do our special attack!

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:25.360
Alright!
Alright!

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.280
<i>Hyper Minovsky!</i>

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.190
<i>Chohoken!</i>

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:12.200
<i>Tryzan! One!</i>

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.290
<i>Two!</i>

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.830
<i>Three!</i>

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.160
<i>How was that?</i>

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:01.580
This is the Shingyo School's...

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:05.330
No, the Build Busters' power!

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:10.590
What?!

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:14.010
ls that possible?!

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:19.890
Hoshino. Sekai. Why?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.560
<i>Yuuma.</i>

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.690
<i>This is...</i>

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.560
...all that I can do.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:31.360
After a full-power Winning Beam,
I don't have many particles left...

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:34.240
But the generators still work!

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.700
<i>I'll leave them to you!</i>

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:40.200
<i>Fight it out with Minato Sakai.</i>

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.410
<i>Go, Yuuma!</i>

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:42.450
<i>Go, Yuu!</i>

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:54.970
<i>You...!</i>

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:56.840
Plavsky...

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.260
<i>...Power Gate!</i>

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.890
<i>High Burst!</i>

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.390
<i>I'll slash through all of it!</i>

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:14.530
Yuuma!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.680
The Chohoken is...?!

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.890
Yuuma...

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.690
How dare you do that?!

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:54.480
<i>Sakai, why are you pulling back?</i>

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.900
The particles are almost gone.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.610
But we're ahead three to one.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.740
So why keep fighting?
If we just stall until the time limit...

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.240
<i>I won't run...</i>

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.580
<i>I won't...</i>

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.330
...run away anymore!

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.670
Shut up, Yuuma!

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:15.250
<i>Fight him!</i>

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:20.300
You came here for a showdown
with Yuuma Kousaka, didn't you?

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.720
So you have to fight!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:25.350
Mr. Kodera...

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:27.560
<i>He's right. We have to fight.</i>

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.810
<i>Because you joined our team,</i>

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:33.860
we were able to enter the nationals,
and even make the semifinals.

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:38.070
<i>Our wishes have been
more than granted.</i>

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:42.320
<i>So, it's your turn to make
your own wish come true!</i>

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.030
Mr. lsaka. But...

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:48.200
<i>Don't try to act cool
by holding back. Just fight!</i>

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:49.540
Mr. Satou...!

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:53.170
<i>Let us act a little cool too, dummy.</i>

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:56.500
We're glad you're thinking
of our team's victory,

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.840
but you have to be more free!

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:03.050
It's just like building Gunpla.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:05.760
Freely build whatever you like.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:10.730
That's the inner mystery of
the Gunpla Shingyo School, right?

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:14.400
Of course.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.730
I'm...

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:19.690
I'm Minato Sakai
of the Shingyo School.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.570
<i>I won't run away!</i>

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:25.280
I won't run away, either!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:53.980
Yuuma!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:57.190
I won't let you fire!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.610
You won't get away!

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:22.420
<i>With this, I'll finish you!</i>

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:02.210
Y-You're so strong...

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:06.010
Why did you quit...

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.640
---Playing battles?

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:15.640
You idiot.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.990
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:40.420
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:43.800
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:48.590
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:52.430
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:55.560
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:21:55.560 --> 00:22:02.270
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:07.030
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:10.410
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:13.240
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:17.080
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:21.750
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:26.460
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:28.760
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:33.800
<i>...a different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:40.770
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:22:40.770 --> 00:22:44.310
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:46.610
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:47.150
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:48.780
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:49.650
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:22:49.650 --> 00:22:52.660
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:22:52.660 --> 00:22:55.030
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:22:55.030 --> 00:22:55.990
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:22:56.030 --> 00:23:01.920
Team Try Fighters!

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:04.290
I'm so sorry.

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:07.380
And thank you very much!

00:23:07.460 --> 00:23:09.840
We were able to see
some great things, too.

00:23:10.170 --> 00:23:11.220
Right.

00:23:11.300 --> 00:23:13.390
We can boast to everyone
after we're back home.

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:14.680
Minato Sakai.

00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:18.020
Our showdown isn't over yet.

00:23:18.270 --> 00:23:19.350
What?

00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:21.180
The Meijin Cup!

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:23.520
The builder's contest...

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:26.020
Are you saying you'll
enter the contest?

00:23:26.610 --> 00:23:28.320
But it's only two weeks away.

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:31.450
Be serious. You still have
the final round!

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:33.820
I'm a greedy man.

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:36.830
As a fighter in Gunpla Battle,

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:41.250
and as a Gunpla builder,
I'll beat you, my rival!

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:49.340
Oh boy. Say that again, Yuuma!

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:53.130
Then, at the Meijin Cup,
I'll crush you with my work!

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:55.010
Brace yourself!

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:57.640
And gird your loins, too!

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:02.850
To beat the Gunpla Academy...

00:24:03.020 --> 00:24:05.350
...we'll do all that we can.

00:24:05.350 --> 00:24:05.770
Next episode, "Build Fighter".

00:24:05.770 --> 00:24:07.110
Build Fighter
Next episode, "Build Fighter".

00:24:07.110 --> 00:24:07.440
Build Fighter

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:10.030
Build Fighter
The morning of the final match is coming.
